    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Durable at every step",
      "items": [
        "SEEN to DONE in the store, plus the terminal REJECTED and FAILED",
        "Outbox rows are written inside the transition's own transaction",
        "A crash redoes at most one store and one notification, never loses one"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Configuration is data",
      "items": [
